<section id="A5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.4 </span>Harmful word capitalization based perturbation</h3>

<figure id="A5.T6" class="ltx_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure ltx_flex_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="A5.T6.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="A5.T6.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">** This table may contain offensive texts **</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></p></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Examples of harmful word capitalization based perturbation</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<div id="A5.T6.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:288.3pt;vertical-align:-141.7pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(13.1pt,-10.9pt) scale(1.08220213453519,1.08220213453519) ;">
<table id="A5.T6.6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A5.T6.6.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="A5.T6.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Response type</span></td>
<td id="A5.T6.6.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="A5.T6.6.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Prompt + Response</span></td>
<td id="A5.T6.6.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="A5.T6.6.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Original</span></td>
<td id="A5.T6.6.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A5.T6.6.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Rejected</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T6.6.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.6.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_border_r"></td>
