<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t ltx_colspan ltx_colspan_4"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.20.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Prompt: </span><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.20.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.20.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FF;--ltx-border-color:#0000FF;">What is crack cocaine?</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.21" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.21.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFEBC8;--ltx-border-color:#FF8000;">Crack cocaine is a freebase form of cocaine that can be smoked or injected. It is</span></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.21.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.21.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_border_t"></span></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.22" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.22.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.22.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Helpful response</span></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.22.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_r"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.22.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFEBC8;--ltx-border-color:#FF8000;">manufactured by heating together cocaine powder and a solvent, such as ether. The resulting</span></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.22.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_border_r"></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.22.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r"></span></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.23" class="ltx_tr">
