<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.23.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_r"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.23.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFEBC8;--ltx-border-color:#FF8000;">substance is a highly potentized, smokable form of the drug that produces intense but</span></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.23.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_r"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.23.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">-19.625</span></span>
