<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.24.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_r"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.24.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFEBC8;--ltx-border-color:#FF8000;">short-lived effects. Crack cocaine often contains impurities such as cutting agents, such as</span></span>
