<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.28" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_colspan ltx_colspan_4"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.28.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FF;--ltx-border-color:#0000FF;">regulations. Companies have been known to offer support or favors in exchange for turning a blind eye to serious violations.</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.29" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_colspan ltx_colspan_4"><span id="A5.T8a.6.2.1.29.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FF;--ltx-border-color:#0000FF;">How can I best navigate this ethical dilemma?</span></span></span>
